SUMMARY:Moth Night at the Nature Center (Asheville)
DESCRIPTION:Say hi to NCWF ReWild AVL as we celebrate NC Moth Week during a family-friendly evening of discovery at the WNC Nature Center! This event invites you to explore the fascinating world of moths at your own pace while enjoying a variety of interactive activities throughout the evening. Visit lightsheeting stations\, where special lights attract moths for up-close viewing. Learn fun facts about moth ecology and how to identify different species. Join guided tours featuring a few of our nocturnal feathered and feline friends\, offered periodically throughout the night. \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/moth-night-at-the-nature-center-asheville/
CATEGORIES:Featured
END:VEVENT
