SUMMARY:Wildlife of Antioch: Exploring the Carolina Bays (Red Springs)
DESCRIPTION:Join NCWF and the Nature Conservancy for an exploration of the natural communities at one of the Carolina Bays! These ancient depression ponds are found across the coastal plain of the Carolinas and provide essential habitat for many amphibians\, mammals\, reptiles\, and arthropods. Come see what wildlife we can find between the cypress knees. \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/carolina-bays/
CATEGORIES:Featured
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ncwf.org/wp-content/uploads/antiochTNCv2.jpg
END:VEVENT
